msgstr "Enhetsmallen GPU Node är inte installerad."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device was not kept: your account may not see devices it creates. Ask an administrator to create it."
msgstr "Enheten behölls inte: ditt konto får inte se enheter som det skapar. Be en administratör skapa den."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be removed after access was refused. Ask an administrator to remove it."
msgstr "Enheten kunde inte tas bort efter att åtkomst nekades. Be en administratör ta bort den."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device and its GPU node were created. Set the device's SNMP settings on its device page."
msgstr "Enheten och dess GPU-nod skapades. Ange enhetens SNMP-inställningar på dess enhetssida."

#: gpu_nodes.php
